{"id":"n90566-4-10","stage":5,"title":"양반 · 对男人的尊称或贬称。","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90566-4-10-1","ko":"그 멀쩡하던 양반이 갑자기 병에 걸리다니.","zh":"那位原本好好的人，怎么突然生病了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个。","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"멀쩡하던","meaning":"好好儿的，好端端的","explanation":"멀쩡하다：好好儿的，好端端的；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"멀쩡하다","audio":"/audio/505a81d41085f8c8ee2f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54972","senseId":"1","lemma":"멀쩡하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"멀쩡하던","audio":"/audio/1d1ab37ce8583bcc82ef.mp3"}},{"text":"양반이","meaning":"对男人的尊称或贬称。","explanation":"양반：对男人的尊称或贬称；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"양반","audio":"/audio/1c8365e97758e1a47313.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90566","senseId":"4","lemma":"양반","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"양반이","audio":"/audio/083ad8c3ad10885a4857.mp3"}},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子。","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}},{"text":"병에","meaning":"病","explanation":"병：病；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"병","audio":"/audio/31eaf1068c99d7f1add7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62694","senseId":"1","lemma":"병","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"병에","audio":"/audio/5e0a2b6f168dd93dfd48.mp3"}},{"text":"걸리다니.","meaning":"患","explanation":"걸리다：患；다니：对听到的内容表示惊讶、感叹或反问。","readings":[{"term":"걸리다","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86940","senseId":"8","lemma":"걸리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸리다니","audio":"/audio/b77439b050f5f278e5c1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代与听话人较近或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"505a81d41085f8c8","term":"멀쩡하다","zh":"好好儿的，好端端的","audio":"/audio/505a81d41085f8c8ee2f.mp3","entryId":"54972","definition":"没有瑕疵或伤痕等，完好无损。","pronunciation":["멀쩡하다"]},{"id":"1c8365e97758e1a4","term":"양반","zh":"对男人的尊称或贬称。","audio":"/audio/1c8365e97758e1a47313.mp3","entryId":"90566","definition":"对男人的尊称或贬称。","pronunciation":["양ː반"]},{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"31eaf1068c99d7f1","term":"병","zh":"病","audio":"/audio/31eaf1068c99d7f1add7.mp3","entryId":"62694","definition":"生物体的身体发生异常，导致生物体无法进行正常活动并感到难受的现象。","pronunciation":["병ː"]},{"id":"d94590a358564fb8","term":"걸리다","zh":"患","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3","entryId":"86940","definition":"得病。","pronunciation":["걸리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/eb65bce24687bb1ac0af.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n90566-4-10-2","ko":"그러게. 참 건강했던 아저씨였는데.","zh":"是啊，那位大叔以前身体很好的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러게.","meaning":"就是嘛，可不嘛","explanation":"그러게：就是嘛，可不嘛。","readings":[{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36269","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确。","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"건강했던","meaning":"健康","explanation":"건강하